text='''# Independent four-owner successor review

The complete four source successors and three installation deferrals are supported with limitations. No new confirmed finding. The saved native YAML/Markdown pair is the authoritative independent assessment.

- Na2seo3: exact56b2 retains CHEBI48843 and valid anhydrous alias; preserves Na2Se2O3 as rejected raw source text. DSMZ863/MediaDive804 reagent remains unresolved.
- Borax: exact6f82 preserves the conventional decahydrate, structurally Na2[B4O5(OH)4]·8H2O, supported by IUCr/ChEBI/supplier. Method records adjudication. Three UW dependencies and the separate DSMZ770 stock hold remain.
- Diarsenic trioxide: exactaa045 preserves oxide input and real As2O3 query, recording empirical/molecular adjudication. No alkaline stock, quantity, polymorph or final-species inference.
- Sulfur: exact77f915 full four-origin/six-case union supports generic elemental material; atom/polysulfur and other rejected labels remain nonresolving. Source-specific powder/process/quantity facts do not become universal properties. #368 canonical comment retention is a separate row decision.
- Exactd403 defers three creates without rewriting four original cases or rejecting supported nominal recipes. Unreported hydration/process/finalvolume proves neither equality nor distinctness. The genuine generic84g/L edit remains separate.

Independent checks:21+202 sealed author members; all four complete-object deltas and original histories/evidence; seven published original origins; four native schema/idempotence checks; authentic2957-owner overlay with three required UW corrections and zero partonomy errors; four actual native per-owner projections with real KG gzip. Method rows change only justification/source/confidence; Na removes only Na2Se2O3 plus source attribution. These are not full-campaign generated-row approvals.

The author native pair and91 original inputs were verified as self-review. This independent native pair has179 exact inputs and passed native check --require-reviews. INPUT-TRANSPORT-v2.json and NATIVE-INPUT-CLOSURE.json retain literal originals, actual Git beforeimages and private-fixture paths. The fixture commit is review-only provenance, not a campaign commit or relocated worker source root. Support artifacts and duplicate captures are not separate votes.

All role/environment/count/quantity/release holds remain. No source acceptance, source apply, maintained/worker/shared-Git/GitHub/control action occurred. Prior operator/constructor authorship is disclosed; that constructor is outside this independent verdict. Original author packets/failures and prior reviews remain immutable. Exploratory format reads were corrected before assessment; an initial closure enumeration omitted the three explicitly Git-derived beforeimages and was completed here without changing any native pair/input/candidate bytes.
'''
